{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["<b>And those who remain.</b> From those who remain." "<b>They shall rot in their iniquity.</b> On the pattern of יִסְּבוּ, and both are from the doubled-root [binyan] class, from the paradigm of מַק־בְּשָׂרוֹ מַק־יִהְיֶה." "<b>And also in the iniquities of their fathers they shall rot with them.</b> Like the meaning of 'our fathers sinned,' and in the scroll of Lamentations I explained it."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:52.060170914Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}